    "body": "The call site at https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#ref-for-string-percent-encode-after-encoding could technically be fed a surrogate code point. Maybe it should have an assert to prevent anyone from doing that.\r\n\r\nSimilarly I don't believe there's any requirement that the input to https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#ref-for-string-percent-encode-after-encoding%E2%91%A5 consist of tuples which contain scalar value strings.",
